/*!
\page page_stetofheader StETofHeader

\brief Event-level timing and status data for the STAR Endcap TOF (eTOF) detector.

\section etofheader_overview Overview

StETofHeader stores per-event header data for the STAR eTOF detector,
operational since Run 19 (2019).

The header records synchronisation information between the eTOF DAQ (gDPB — general Data Processing Board)
and the STAR global trigger system:
- \c mTrgGdpbFullTime: absolute gDPB trigger timestamp [ns] (eTOF local clock).
- \c mTrgStarFullTime: STAR global trigger timestamp [ns].

Per-ROC timestamp maps allow clock-synchronisation diagnostics.
Quality vectors (\c mMissMatchFlagVec, \c mGoodEventFlagVec, \c mHasPulsersVec) carry
per-Get4 and per-counter health indicators for each event.

The object is held by \ref StETofCollection via StEvent::etofCollection()->etofHeader().

\section etofheader_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code{.txt}
TObject → StObject → StETofHeader
\endcode

\section etofheader_members Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| mTrgGdpbFullTime | Double_t | gDPB trigger timestamp [ns] |
| mTrgStarFullTime | Double_t | STAR trigger timestamp [ns] |
| mRocGdpbTs | map<UInt_t, ULong64_t> | Per-ROC gDPB timestamps |
| mRocStarTs | map<UInt_t, ULong64_t> | Per-ROC STAR timestamps |
| mStarToken | UInt_t | STAR trigger token |
| mStarDaqCmdIn | UInt_t | STAR DAQ command input |
| mStarTrgCmdIn | UInt_t | STAR trigger command input |
| mEventStatusFlag | ULong64_t | 64-bit event status bitmask |
| mMissMatchFlagVec | vector<Bool_t> | Per-Get4 TDC mismatch flags |
| mGoodEventFlagVec | vector<Bool_t> | Per-counter good-event flags |
| mHasPulsersVec | vector<Bool_t> | Per-counter has-pulsers flags |

\section etofheader_methods Key Methods

- trgGdpbFullTime() — gDPB trigger timestamp [ns]
- trgStarFullTime() — STAR trigger timestamp [ns]
- rocGdpbTs(), rocStarTs() — per-ROC timestamp maps
- starToken() — STAR trigger token
- eventStatusFlag() — event status bitmask
- missMatchFlagVec() — per-Get4 mismatch flags
- goodEventFlagVec() — per-counter good-event flags
- hasPulsersVec() — per-counter has-pulsers flags

\section etofheader_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
StETofCollection* coll = event->etofCollection();
if (coll) {
    StETofHeader* hdr = coll->etofHeader();
    if (hdr) {
        double dt    = hdr->trgGdpbFullTime() - hdr->trgStarFullTime();
        auto goodVec = hdr->goodEventFlagVec();
        // goodVec[i] == true: counter i had no mismatches and has pulsers
    }
}
\endcode

\see StETofHit, StETofDigi, StETofCollection
*/
